{"seq":1,"mint":"C7","verb":"claim","status":"ok","model":"openai/gpt-6-luna","approach":"split","literals":true,"findings":[{"kind":"contradicts","clause":"`ExtentEntry` already carries four `#[serde(default)]` fields whose absence is documented as \"not recorded\" rather than as a default value","clause_quoted":true,"facts":[],"why":"The captured documentation gives an absent `world_root` a default empty-string value with specific meaning; it is not documented merely as “not recorded.”","quoted":false,"rejected_span":"`world_root` is `#[serde(default)]` for entries minted before it\n/// existed. An empty root is not \"unknown repository\" — it marks a\n/// state\n/// that was resolved from the process's working directory rather than\n/// from what the observation touched, and is therefore comparable with\n/// nothing. `check` treats it that way rather than guessing."}],"at":1790153569,"cost":0.003934196,"elapsed_ms":17658,"attempts":3,"not_verbatim":0,"literals_refuted":2,"not_a_quantity":0,"kind_off_verb":0,"refuted":0,"typed_versions":["jev-1.13.0"],"gate_calls":1,"typed_classify_calls":1,"typed_literal_calls":0}
